<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '60px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A' }}>一页看全：市场、账户、每一笔</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#D9DEE6', marginTop: 12 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 14 }}>
        <Image src="assets/hero.png" style={{ width: 760, height: 392, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6, border: '1px solid #E5E9F0' }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 12 }}>
        {[
            ['01', '首屏', '5,577 只的市场，和你的 31 笔'],
            ['02', '画像', '16 型、四维坐标、怎么改'],
            ['03', '逐笔', '11 手的 0–100 合理性'],
        ].map(function (it, i) {
            return (
                <Box key={i} style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B08D57', width: 38 }}>{it[0]}</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A' }}>{it[1]}</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 2 }}>{it[2]}</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            );
        })}
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A1A1A', marginTop: 12 }}>
        答辩不切窗口，关键界面都在这份 PPT 里；<span style={{ color: '#64748B' }}>可点的完整版在仓库 docs/demo.html。</span>
    </Text>
</Slide>
